{"version":1,"key":"article:40","content":{"id":40,"title":"离散时间傅里叶变换","author":"","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"818561f4-622d-4740-adbf-284b5cfa3858","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"定义"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9701bd6f-66cb-4465-951d-4763175fb90d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们定义离散时间傅里叶(DTFT)变换为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"X(e^{jw})=\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}x[n]e^{-jwn}","collabId":"9d8c03e6-3b07-4773-8651-9d7b7d28692a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"940eda40-42b6-4706-b19f-739f63a99b13","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其实我在书上看到这里的时候不太理解为什么离散傅里叶变换要这么定义，其实书上直接给出这么一个公式有一点马后炮的感觉，我想知道这个公式为什么这么定义，想知道的是一个设计的过程，这么定义为什么能够给出频谱密度，所以接下来谈谈我的理解。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f13568d9-fb34-44bc-9e64-21598ede9adb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说到频谱密度的话，我们其实对连续傅里叶变换比较了解，并且知道为什么连续傅里叶变换为什么能反映连续信号的频谱密度，所以我打算从连续时间信号进行入手。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7552965b-b53c-4d43-87b7-7e4ccb04b46b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑离散时间信号 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x[n]","collabId":"1709ddc3-4299-44fd-bc8f-7f16741bc1ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"x[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是对连续时间信号 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"x_a(t)","collabId":"0c081b0a-e8bc-4672-8321-757574582bf8","children":[{"type":"fo