","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"证明："}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\delta[n]e^{-jwn}=1","collabId":"b8fe0026-5775-4035-aebe-23d788ddac38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"orange","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"47c868f4-1f04-4e90-b9e0-970a247f8ba2","children":[{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"1(-\\infty < n > \\infty)\\xleftrightarrow{DTFT}\\sum_{k=-\\infty}^{\\infty}2\\pi \\delta(w+2\\pi k)","collabId":"b1773e0a-c458-4fe0-a05d-a204c41cfd22","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5bc3b0a7-5156-499a-8fd7-7bcffe784606","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"证明：由于常数1既不是绝对可和序列，也不是平方可和序列，所以其傅里叶变换为带有狄拉克函数，证其傅里叶变换比较困难，可以从其反变换入手"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\sum_{k=-\\infty}^{\\infty}2\\pi \\delta(w+2\\pi k)dw=1","collabId":"bdc91007-73a7-4ed3-8619-3b90c188e127","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"orange","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"e86c204e-dc1b-45db-9f53-3b316371766e","children":[{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\mu[n]\\xleftrightarrow{DTFT}\\frac{1}{1-e^{-jw}}+\\sum_{k=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\pi \\delta(w+2\\pi k)","collabId":"81f54533-99f4-44a2-8d00-2fcd07673318","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c26ee779-49a7-46b4-a0a0-0d7880fd418b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"证明："},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\mu[n]","collabId":"1af9e3a6-a0a1-4c68-b04c-c34453e261ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\mu[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 既不是绝对可和序列，也不是平方可和序列，还是得从另外的方法去证，将 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"\\mu[n]","collabId":"e4825a99-b884-4136-946c-ee9512dd8d3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\mu[n]"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分解为偶部和奇部，则其偶部为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y_{ev}[n]=\\frac{1}{2}(\\mu[n]+\\mu[-n])=\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\delta[n]","collabId":"8742497d-5aa4-404d-8652-f80af2a70779","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d57f22db-f1f0-4c24-8dba-0c48dab81bbf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其傅里叶变换为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"Y_{ev}(e^{jw})=\\sum_{k=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\pi \\delta(w+2\\pi k)+\\frac{1}{2}","collabId":"27a8a037-3377-49ac-9fbf-459943f25ea3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5513fed4-2a71-4c6d-aff7-ec95d69a1e01","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其奇部为"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"y_{od}[n]=\\frac{1}{2}(\\mu[n]-\\mu[-n])=\\frac{1}{2}(2\\mu[n]-(\\mu[n]+\\mu[-n]))=\\mu[n]-\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\delta[n]","collabId":"390f893c-2c8b-4574-b2c3-9356fc978fd1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3